# Customer Onboarding Guide

## Phase 1: Kickoff (Week 1)

### Day 1: Welcome Call
- Introductions and team alignment
- Review project scope and timeline
- Confirm success criteria

### Day 2-5: Discovery
- Data source identification
- Use case prioritization
- Technical requirements gathering

## Phase 2: Implementation (Weeks 2-4)

### Week 2: Data Integration
- Connect data sources
- Configure data pipelines
- Validate data quality

### Week 3: Dashboard Development
- Build initial dashboards
- Configure user access
- Set up alerts and notifications

### Week 4: Training
- Admin training (2 hours)
- End-user training (1 hour)
- Q&A session

## Phase 3: Go-Live (Week 5-6)

### Week 5: User Acceptance Testing
- UAT with customer team
- Address feedback
- Final adjustments

### Week 6: Launch
- Production cutover
- Hypercare support (2 weeks)
- Success metrics review

## Success Criteria
- All data sources connected
- 5+ dashboards deployed
- 80% user adoption within 30 days
- Customer satisfaction score >8/10

